NJsHkWk7fxA__#sha256=C2yTV7RDryu0ymuuVPa7QXfgarf5ZLp02UDuxdUtfAc"}]}]},"createdAt":"2020-03-04T14:19:56.916Z","metadata":{"description":"Richard Briers, Adrian Scarborough and Terence Rigby star in this full-cast dramatisation, narrated by Alan Bennett. When Mole abandons his spring cleaning one morning, he surfaces into the sunlight and encounters the Water Rat. Mole stays with Ratty in his snug waterside home, and soon he meets Ratty’s friends: Badger, who lives in the Wild Wood, and the incorrigible Toad of Toad Hall. This timeless tale of waterside Britain has been loved by generations of children and acclaimed as a classic. The story of Mole, Ratty, Badger and Toad and their escapades never fails to enchant. Many of the original cast from Alan Bennett's acclaimed National Theatre production appear in this Radio 4 dramatisation, including Richard Briers as Rat, Adrian Scarborough as Mole and Terence Rigby as Albert – with Alan Bennett as the narrator.","category":"stories","author":"Kenneth Grahame","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/bbc-the-wind-in-the-willows.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"UK English","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/audio-previews/c2ac1595563a9857899a22457c1b13c0c963f359d4e88e8fb99f3d76def24d80/n1M-nyL5KoV2qk2HPipyRo79hIqQJ52hK-5uib-b1eg.mp3","copyright":"© 1989 Kenneth Grahame","maxAge":9,"minAge":5,"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/RSbxr-PyDaV2cPYDVtjyoRcbnXW2-OYwOnxVuuw5-Gw"},"languages":["en"],"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2020-11-19T13:20:05.553Z"},"media":{"duration":8419,"fileSize":69334742,"hasStreams":false},"accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Kenneth Grahame"],"copyrights":["© 1989 Kenneth Grahame"],"genres":["classics"],"narrators":["Alan Bennet","Richard Briers","full cast"]},"slug":"bbc-the-wind-in-the-willows","title":"The Wind in the Willows","updatedAt":"2024-06-11T10:41:30.174Z","userId":"yoto","clubAvailability":[],"sortk